          "literalMeaning": "due to the differentiation of corresponding objects (grāhya) and subjects (grāhaka)"
        }
      ],
      "studyGloss": "That universe becomes manifold through the differentiation of mutually corresponding subjects and objects.",
      "practicalContext": "Explains how multiplicity arises: every level of object has a corresponding level of observer. From gods down to minerals, Consciousness divides itself into perceivers and perceptions.",
